  "kind": "bit-matching-detail",
  "title": "ISPMT stores (per - nper), then * pv, then * rate, then / nper on x87 and admits negative nper",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0 build 20527, ISPMT(rate, per, nper, pv) rejects nper = 0 with #DIV/0! and evaluates the four-stage stored x87 sequence difference = RN53(RN64(per - nper)), scaled = RN53(RN64(pv * difference)), interest = RN53(RN64(scaled * rate)), result = RN53(RN64(interest / nper)), rejecting nonfinite results with #NUM! and admitting negative nper under the same formula. Dividing per / nper first or combining rate * pv first changes final bits. All 4,341 full-bank ISPMT rows match.",
  "status": "inferred",
